BUVLO[2:0]: 3.0 / 2.8 / 2.6 / 2.4 / 2.2 V (nearest below `mv` is chosen);
deeper cutoff trades battery life for runtime. Other BUVLO fields
(precharge threshold, OCP limit) are preserved.
